WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.470
Norfolk, England

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:13.530
Leticia-sama!

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.890
Leticia-sama!

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.040
Leticia-sama!

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.540
Oh, my... How unseemly of 
me to fall asleep out here.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.050
The sun just felt so nice.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:31.210
A day like this would 
make anyone feel drowsy.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.790
That's just how humans are.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.210
Are you here on business?

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:37.930
Yes.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:41.560
We just received a summons 
from Monsieur Guy.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.810
We must respond.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.790
Very well, Moses.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:49.820
Let's go, along with the others.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.280
The Former Capital, London

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.710
Déraciné sighted.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:08.790
Entering combat to destroy it.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:53.510
How truly splendid.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.760
So long as we have the Buranki 
Epimeu and Leticia to control it,

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.190
Europe's security is assured.

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:11.600
No matter the era,
the masses long for a hero.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:15.990
She is truly the second 
coming of Jeanne d'Arc.

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:19.450
<b>Half a Month After the Fall of Treasure Island</b>

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:22.980
Taiwan

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:28.490
So this is Taipei Station?!

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:29.820
Taipei Station

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:29.830
It's huge!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.360
So this is the Presidential 
Office Building?!

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:36.050
Presidential Office Building

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:36.050
Presidential Office Building! 
Presidential Office Building!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.050
So this is the Chiang 
Kai-Shek Memorial Hall?!

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.170
Chiang Kai-Shek Memorial Hall

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.300
It's so white! So blue! So pretty!

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.200
So this is a Taiwanese dog?!

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:44.260
Taiwanese Dog

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.260
Wow! It's just like Japanese dogs!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.750
So this is Taiwan...

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.230
So this is Taiwan, huh, Kino-chan?

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:55.210
Shizuru-chan, did you find 
someplace you want to go?

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:56.980
Wait, what is that book?!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.990
<b>Field Guide to Ores and Minerals 
A World of Striking Colors</b>

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.990
It's not a guide book for Taiwan?!

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.420
I want this stone.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:10.530
<b>1. Kongouseki</b>

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:06.560
Wow, it's so pretty!
It looks like a diamond!

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:10.540
"Kongouseki"... That <i>is</i> a diamond!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:14.340
We'll never be able to buy one of 
those with the pocket change we have!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.210
Darn...

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:19.020
Also, also! Know what I 
wanna buy? A swimsuit!

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.530
A swimsuit? Isn't it too early?

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:24.700
It's warm in Taiwan, so I bet 
we could swim here already!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:25.700
You think so?

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.100
Darn...

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.200
Ooh! That looks tasty!

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.330
That's the legendary mango shaved ice,

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.480
and the legendary tapioca milk tea!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:36.880
A-chan is probably getting 
hungry around now,

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:40.440
so let's meet him at the airport 
with lots of Taiwanese specialties!

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:43.580
Yeah, since he was the only one 
to have trouble in immigration

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:45.850
and ended up on a later flight.

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.630
A-chan, it's your turn.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.050
Oh... Right.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.060
Thanks, Kogane-chan.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:55.990
Sure.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.920
Don't put your hands on the counter.

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:03.340
<b>Immigration Control 
Please present your passport
 and boarding pass</b>

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.340
Oh... Okay.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.260
Kazuki Azuma...

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:10.140
Oh, you're the witch's son?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.900
My mom is not a witch!

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:12.980
Now, now...

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.830
There shouldn't be a problem 
with his documents.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:21.070
Even with all of his documents,
there are still procedures to follow,

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.420
if a heart user wants to leave the country.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.020
A-chan, calm down!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.280
A-chan...

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:31.420
We'll be waiting for you in Taiwan!

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:35.210
Bye-bye! Bye-bye!

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:39.040
Bye-bye!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:43.720
He's a mama's boy <i>and</i> afraid of heights!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.800
He's got way too many weaknesses!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.420
Yeah, even though he fought on a 
place as high up as Treasure Island!

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:52.060
I was so caught up in the 
battle, I didn't notice!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.630
Shizuru-chan, that sounded just like him!

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.630
That's hilarious!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.860
Hey! Hey!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.270
Hey! You guys!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.990
Don't forget why we came here!

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:03.990
We're in Taiwan to look for

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:07.410
the body of Oubu that fell into 
the sea with Treasure Isla—

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:09.740
What's that?

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.370
That's the headless Buranki that 
fell from Treasure Island!

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:17.920
This is...

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.530
The Taiwan airport!

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:20.520
The airport?!

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:25.180
But A-chan's flight is due to arrive soon!

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:27.230
Get us to the airport, quick!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.360
I don't care! Just do it!

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:36.480
We don't know which way the airport is!

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.180
Do it.

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:57.620
I see it!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.080
All right! Let's go!

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.880
Himekiri! Hoemaru!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.480
Thanks for the ride!

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.550
Let's go, Righty-chan!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:08.380
Iwatooshi!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:10.890
Xie xie.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:17.940
All right, let's make a little mayhem!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.130
We don't have Azuma,
so we can't fuse into Oubu.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.170
Don't get too reckless, you guys!

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:23.980
Right!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.240
There it is!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.260
There are people here.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.240
What?!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.600
A Bubuki?

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:42.540
They're Bubuki users, too?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.550
Wow! Their Bubuki got bigger!

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.330
Quite impressive.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:11.530
Who the heck are those guys?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:15.650
Still, they can't finish off the 
headless Buranki with Bubuki alone.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.450
Damn...

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:22.540
All right! A big "thank 
you" to our opening act!

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:28.050
My faithful servants from the Asian team,
you've done great work!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:33.140
Seeing the limbs, even if they're 
ordinary people, working so hard

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.550
makes Kaoruko so happy!

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.390
But of course, it has to be me, 
Kaoruko, that deals the final blow!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:45.140
So now, it's time for our ultra, super, 
delicious, gorgeous, deluxe fusion—

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:46.320
Oops, wrong one.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.250
Oubu!

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:12.010
Is that...

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.770
Oubu? Why does she have that?!

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:17.930
But Hii-kun, the color's 
different! It's all black!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.240
Squid Ink Oubu.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.910
A black Oubu?

00:08:20.910 --> 00:08:22.520
What the heck's going on?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.560
Sheesh, it's so cramped in here.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.240
I can hardly breathe.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.530
Come on!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.790
O-Ouch!

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.980
That really hurts! That seriously hurts!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.620
I really am linked to Oubu, huh?
Man, talk about scary.

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:52.590
And how could you hit me there?

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.220
What are you gonna do if they get squashed?!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.470
You brainless nitwit! Enemy of all girls!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.470
You won't get away with that!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:16.980
And now to finish this!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.910
Hey, you guys in the audience!

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:29.080
How was that? Did you enjoy it?

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:37.350
I'm Kaoruko! Kazuki Kaoruko!

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:39.300
Ka—

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:39.930
Ka—

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.220
Kazuki Kaoruko...

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:44.540
No way... Is that girl...

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.480
Azuma's...

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.950
younger sister?!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.980
<b>Episode 13
Black Oubu</b>

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:50.980
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI
The Gentle Giants
 of the Galaxy</i></b>

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:55.490
<b><i>BUBUKI/BURANKI</i></b>

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.490
<b>The Gentle Giants of the Galaxy</b>

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.580
Hey, wait! Wait up!

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:08.440
So, you said earlier that 
your name was Kazuki...

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:09.510
You want an autograph?

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:12.250
You don't have to be in such a rush, then.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.120
Huh?

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.840
Uh, no, I didn't say that...

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.370
Okay, give me your autograph 
board. Well, hurry it up!

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:24.850
You guys recovered the body of Oubu 
after it fell in the sea, right?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:27.710
But how are you able to control Oubu?

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:31.360
Hey! What the hell did you do?!

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.570
No need to thank me.

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:36.190
Hey, by any chance, are you A-chan's...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:38.240
I mean, Azuma-kun's younger sister?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.980
Don't! Don't! Stop! Stopper! Stoppest!

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:45.090
I don't want to hear the word "Azuma"!
It hurts my ears!

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.320
So you really are Azuma's little sister.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.370
Sister?! I am not Azuma's little sister!

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:55.710
I'm basically the little sister 
of everyone in Taiwan!

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:00.420
I think I'm starting to get a headache.

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:01.720
Déjà vu...

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:08.110
If a highly intelligent conversation 
with me is making your head hurt,

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:10.890
you must have a very small brain. Poor dear.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.980
Wh-What?!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.300
You little... Bring it on!

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:18.020
Kinoa, chill out! Just calm down!

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:21.830
All of your nutrition just went to 
your chest instead, I bet. Okay?

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:22.780
What'd you say?!

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:26.370
Damn it, Hiiragi, let me go! Let go!

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.410
Come on, Kinoa, violence isn't the answer...

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:28.820
Fine.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.130
If you insist, I'll tell you.

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:36.420
All the things you want to 
know, from this... to <i>that</i>.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.600
Kino-chan, just calm down!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.110
You don't wanna do it! Seriously!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.570
Hey! Kogane! Where do you 
think you're pushing, idiot?!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.120
Sorry.

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:48.140
You definitely had lots 
of nutrition end up here!

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:51.090
Follow me.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:57.630
<b>Lehua Night Market</b>

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:08.500
Wow! This looks great!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:09.450
Drool...

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.610
Thanks for always dropping in.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:12.360
Oh, no.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:13.860
I should thank you.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:15.700
No need to be polite.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:16.620
Eat up.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:17.780
Okay!

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.250
What's with you? Just eat it already.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.130
Can we, Kaoruko-chan?

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:28.600
A kid shouldn't be so modest. Sheesh.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.870
Let's dig in!

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:34.290
This is so good!

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:35.840
L-Let's eat.

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.690
Give me grass... please.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:46.450
That outfit is so cute! Super cute!

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:50.020
Thank you.

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:53.010
My name is Chou. Chou Ouran.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:55.370
Ouran? Ouran-chan?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.500
Your name's cute, too! 
Chou-chan, you're <i>chou</i> cute!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.620
I'm Asabuki Kogane.

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:01.980
This is Righty-chan.

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:05.430
Kogane-chan... You're very cute, too!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.930
Aw, I'm not really...

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:12.430
Lakshmi.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.940
Lakshmi. That's my name.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:20.410
It's the name of the goddess of 
beauty, wealth, and fortune.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.820
What's your name?

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:26.990
M-My name's Hiiragi...

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.770
I mean, it's Nono Hiiragi.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.490
Oh...

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:34.080
You have very long ring fingers.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.070
Huh?

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:38.670
That's wonderful. Men with long ring fingers

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.140
will be successful in the future.

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:42.590
The f-f-f-f-future?!

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:46.030
No way! It's much too soon for that!

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.750
We need more time to get 
to know each other...

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:55.620
<i>She has a mature appeal that the 
girls on our team don't have!</i>

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:56.810
<i>And...</i>

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:01.820
<i>I-Is this what they call 
the "global standard"?!</i>

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:11.930
<i>Wait, what good will it do to compare?</i>

00:14:11.930 --> 00:14:14.500
<i>Everyone's unique... 
Everyone's unique, right?</i>

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:17.190
<i>Individuality! Right!</i>

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.120
<i>That's what they call "individuality"!</i>

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.220
Right, Kino— ah!

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:25.130
Oops, sorry, Hiiragi.
My hand just moved on its own.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:27.130
Namu...

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.020
Hey, you said you're Kaoruko, right?

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.560
You're the leader of this team?

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:42.670
"No. This team's official 
leader is elsewhere."

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.990
"I'm only borrowing this team 
to achieve a certain goal."

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:50.320
Goal?

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.810
Forget all that. Where is Azuma?

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:57.160
Oh, crap! I said "Azuma"! 
My mouth's gonna rot!

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:02.060
First of all, we may be twins, 
but we're totally different!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.070
<b>Cute</b>

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.070
<b>Stupid</b>

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:05.170
I'm cuter, I'm smarter,

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.670
and I'm more athletic.

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:08.630
Just calling him "Stupid Azuma" is plenty!

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.050
Augh! I said "Azuma" again!

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:14.440
Cold, cold, cold...

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:18.870
A-chan is circling around in the 
sky in an airplane right now.

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:23.310
The plane can't land because 
of what happened earlier.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:24.820
Hey...

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:27.520
Hey, boy, are you okay?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.520
Yes, I'm fine.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.070
The black Oubu was so strong.

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:37.080
How are you able to use Oubu?

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:41.390
Because I, the genius heart user,

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:45.340
am allowing these ordinary 
people to act as my limbs!

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:46.720
Ordinary?

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.480
What are you talking about?

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.920
They were using their Bubuki like pros!

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:55.430
Why don't you guys get mad when 
she talks about you like that?

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.420
Huh? Well...

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:02.010
How did you get the heart, anyway?

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:05.900
Didn't Azuma inherit Oubu's 
heart from Migiwa-san?

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:07.990
A black...

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:09.410
...heart?

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.400
Oops, pardon me.

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.130
I borrowed this from Guy-sama.

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:15.330
Guy?

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.250
Guy Barville Abeille.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.740
He's the president of Demokratia,

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:22.480
the organization founded 
to rid the world of the

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.560
evil presences known as Buranki,

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:27.540
and the one who commands all 
the Bubuki users of the world.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.260
Guy Barville Abeille...

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:33.210
So the lardo from America 
and those guys from Russia

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:35.300
are all working for him, too?

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:37.490
That's right, that's right.

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:41.310
Let's get moving to our next stop.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.880
So then I let him have it!

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.620
I said, "Shut your big mouth and..."

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.860
My, your luck line is so straight.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.460
Y-You, too, Shizuru-chan?!

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.460
Mine's normally pretty quiet.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:12.410
A-chan, please hurry and come back to us!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:17.220
What's this place?

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:22.420
This is a secret school we go to 
that's just for Bubuki users.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.140
Guy-sama built it.

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.870
So you guys are all classmates, then?

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.440
Yes, I suppose.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:37.950
Boom! Rumble, rumble... 
Ker-splash! Blub, blub, blub...

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.310
And that's how Treasure Island 
sank into the sea, right?

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:43.410
How do you know about that?

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.330
Because I was right there, watching.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:50.230
From my front-row seat on a 
deluxe luxury cruise liner.

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.050
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.900
I mean, for all its problems, 
it was where I grew up.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.910
I was sad to see it go.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:17:59.180
So very sad.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.690
You fell to Earth from

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:04.710
Treasure Island with A-chan 
when you were little, right?

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.250
What did you do after that?

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.190
What? You're asking questions 
about my private life now?

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.750
You want to know about my past that much?

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:12.370
Uh...

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.320
Okay, fine. I'll tell you.

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.260
Just when I'd gotten used to life on Earth,

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.780
one day, out of the blue, my dad said,

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.950
"I'll make him the strongest 
man in the world,"

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:25.570
about that idiot, and left on a 
trip around the world to find him.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.780
I was left in this school's 
dormitory, all alone.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.770
Oh, poor me!

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:33.040
The heroine of my own tragedy!

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:35.700
So then I grew up in this 
foreign country, all alone,

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.970
without becoming cynical or anything at all.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:43.480
So this city is like my second hometown.

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:47.980
People here are so nice, 
the nature is beautiful,

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.830
and it's the city that I love.

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:52.980
So I won't let anyone destroy it.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.000
I won't let anyone die.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:19:00.280
This is where you've been, Kazuki Kaoruko?

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:01.570
Ryuuki!

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.540
Listen, Kaoruko...

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:11.580
Don't you think it's about time 
you returned my limbs to me?

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.400
I can't do that.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:17.010
I haven't completed my 
mission from Guy-sama yet.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:19.150
Well, give them back soon.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:23.620
I don't want my limbs picking 
up any weird habits.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:33.270
Bet it was nice to be so carefree
while I've been away, huh, Haku?

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:38.280
Looks like Kaoruko is a lot 
nicer than I am, huh, On?

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:46.730
Are you all buddy-buddy 
with Kaoruko now, Ouran?

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.290
Hey!

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:51.790
Ouran!

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:55.920
Hey, come on. That's a 
bit of an overreaction.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:20:01.030
You guys make it look like I've 
been really cruel to you.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.550
Right, Lakshmi?

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:06.450
You understand, don't you, Lakshmi?

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:10.060
Everything I've done has been 
in the name of tough love.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:15.230
Yes. We are ever grateful for 
your guidance, Ryuuki-sama.

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:19.400
Get out there and spread 
your wings while you can.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:23.490
In return, you'll work even 
harder for me when I come back.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.440
Who are you?

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:30.250
Rude thing to do to someone 
you've never met.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:33.000
You are the worst kind of bastard there is!

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.450
What are you so mad about?

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:37.460
This is none of your business.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.340
It damn well is!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:43.930
I'm a Bubuki user with a Buranki's 
left foot, just like Lakshmi!

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:48.920
Then you should understand just as well!

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:51.960
The limbs are nothing more 
than the heart's servants.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:55.940
They're just slaves with no abilities 
other than to obey my orders!

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.980
These limbs were prepared 
specifically for my use.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:03.820
I don't need to hear complaints from you.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:08.210
I'm free to treat them however I please.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.830
I'll kill you.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.640
What?! That light...

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:20.550
It's the light of a Buranki fusion!

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:21.960
What?!

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:27.390
The color of that Rinzu light...

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.800
It's Maxim and Zanpaza!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.140
Does he want to turn this 
city into a battlefield?

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.970
Everyone! Let's go!

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:44.450
Well, let's see what you can do, Kaoruko.

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:48.950
Show me the power that your mother 
supposedly passed down to you,

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:51.990
daughter of the witch.
